  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0-rc.3 — final polish pass before 1.0.0; tracks PostQuantum.FileEncryption 1.0.0-rc.3 in lockstep. The .pqfe container format (v2) is FROZEN for 1.x. Documentation polished for production positioning: new docs/MIGRATION.md (from-other-libraries guide) and docs/SUPPLY-CHAIN.md (SBOM/attestation/conformance verification recipe). Hybrid remains the single recommended public-key path with side-by-side migration guidance from the deprecated inline ML-KEM-only mode in the core (PQFE002). Suite-versioning lockstep with the core enforced by the release workflow. EnablePackageValidation against the 1.0.0-rc.2 baseline. No format, public-API, or runtime-dependency changes.",
